Score each parameter from 0 to 10 using these anchors:
  0-2: Not demonstrated or severely lacking
  3-4: Below expectations, significant gaps
  5-6: Adequate, meets basic expectations
  7-8: Strong performance, above average
  9-10: Exceptional, best-in-class execution

